  "description": "First Kashif strategy, built from the Trade Like a Stock Market Wizard manifesto. Combines market regime gate, trend template (hard filter), category tagging, fundamentals screen, entry timing (VCP), and risk/exit rules. Virtual capital only.",
  "status": "draft_not_yet_backtested",
  "changelog": [
    {
