      "changes": [
        "fundamentals_screen: clarified composite scoring architecture — 6 core sub-screens sum to 1.0 (math unchanged, now documented explicitly), deceleration_flag clarified as a penalty applied AFTER the core sum (not an ambiguous 7th weighted component)",
