        "fundamentals_screen: added partial_fundamentals_data handling for Mubasher-fallback tickers missing the revenue field — exclude the affected sub-screen and renormalize remaining weights, never guess",
        "fundamentals_screen: added cross-source consistency check for earnings_acceleration and code_33 — mark 'unconfirmed' for a quarter if the ticker's data source changed since the prior quarter",
        "fundamentals_screen: added earnings_quality fallback to price_reaction_to_earnings only, when deeper checks (guidance reversal, one-time-item stripping) aren't computable at current EGX data depth"
      ],
      "source": "feature-02-fundamentals-screen-rules.md"
